  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Centre for Eastern European Studies (SCEEUS). SCEEUS is an independent think tank and knowledge centre. The centre provides a meeting place nationally and internationally for dialogue and exchange about the region. In addition to the production of written reports and analyses, SCEEUS arranges seminars, conferences, lectures and roundtable discussions.</narrative>
